🎯 Canva Catalog Design Prompt - Lama Computers
📋 Project Overview
Create a professional, modern catalog for Lama Computers (Computer Trading LLC) based in Dubai. The catalog should showcase IT services, computer products, and solutions with a clean, corporate design that appeals to both B2B and B2C customers.
🎨 Design Style & Mood
	•	Style: Modern corporate with tech-forward elements
	•	Mood: Professional, trustworthy, innovative, premium
	•	Layout: Clean grid-based design with ample white space
	•	Visual Language: Minimalist with strategic use of icons and geometric shapes
	•	Target Audience: Businesses, gamers, home users, educational institutions
🌈 Color Palette (Canva-Friendly)
Primary Blue: #2563eb
Main brand color, buttons, links
Dark Navy: #0f172a
Headers, footer, text
Accent Gold: #f59e0b
Highlights, CTAs, icons
Success Green: #10b981
