Medium Gray: #64748b
Body text, descriptions
🔤 Typography (Canva Font Names)
	•	Primary Font: Inter or Montserrat (Bold, Black weights for headers)
	•	Secondary Font: Open Sans or Lato (Regular, Medium for body)
	•	Display Font: Poppins (Extra Bold for main headlines)
	•	Font Sizes:
	◦	Main Headline: 48-60px
	◦	Section Headers: 32-36px
	◦	Subheaders: 24-28px
	◦	Body Text: 14-16px
	◦	Small Text: 12-14px
📐 Layout Structure (Canva Frame Sizes)
	1	Header Section: 1200x300px frame
	◦	White background with subtle shadow
	◦	Company name (no logo)
	◦	Tagline: "Computer Trading LLC"
	◦	Contact button
	2	Hero Section: 1200x600px frame
	◦	Blue gradient background
	◦	Main headline + subheadline
	◦	Two CTA buttons
	◦	Abstract tech graphics
	3	Services Grid: 6 cards (380x400px each)
	◦	White cards with shadow
	◦	Icon + title + description + features
	◦	Hover effect simulation
	4	Product Categories: 4 horizontal cards
	◦	Icon + title + brief description
	◦	Clean, minimal design
	5	Contact Section: 1200x500px frame
	◦	Dark background
	◦	3 contact cards with icons
	◦	Highlighted contact details
	6	Footer: 1200x300px frame
	◦	Dark background
	◦	3 columns: About, Quick Links, Services
	◦	Copyright section
