	•	Images: Use high-quality tech/product photos with blue tint overlay
⚡ Interactive Elements (For Digital Version)
	•	Buttons: Primary (blue gradient), Secondary (outline)
	•	Cards: Hover effects with lift and shadow increase
	•	Animations: Fade-in on scroll, subtle pulse effects
	•	Scroll Behavior: Smooth scrolling to sections
📄 Canva Export Settings
	•	Format: PDF Print (for print), PDF Standard (for digital)
	•	Color Profile: CMYK for print, RGB for digital
	•	Quality: High quality (300 DPI for print)
	•	Page Size: A4 (210x297mm) or US Letter (8.5x11")
	•	Margins: 10mm all sides
