🚀 Quick Start Instructions
	1	Open Canva and create custom size: 1200x2000px
	2	Set background to gradient: #f8fafc to #e2e8f0
	3	Add geometric shapes with specified colors and opacity (5-10%)
	4	Create each section as separate frames
	5	Use Inter or Montserrat fonts
	6	Apply color palette consistently
	7	Add icons from Canva's icon library
	8	Replace placeholder text with provided copy
	9	Export as PDF Print for high quality
